    "romaji": "Gendai shakai ni oite, SNS wa seikatsu ni kakasenai sonzai to natta ga, sono ribensei to hikikae ni, puraibashī no hogo to iu shinkoku na kadai o tsukitsukerarete iru. Nanigenai nichijō no tōkō de atte mo, tokutei no basho ya ningen kankei o suisoku saseru jōhō ga fukumarete iru koto ga sukunakunai. Ichido intānetto-jō ni ryūshutsu shita jōhō wa, kanzen ni sakujo suru koto ga kiwamete konnan de aru. Sono tame, riyōsha ni wa, mizukara no jōhō ga dō atsukawaru ka o reisei ni mikiwameru riterashī ga, katsute nai hodo motomerarete iru to ieyō.",
