    "romaji": "Kinnen, jinkouchinou ni yoru geijutsu seisei ga chuumoku o abiteiru. AI wa boudai na deeta kara gakushuu shi, ningen to mimagau hodo no sakuhiin o kuridasu koto ga kanou ni natta. Shikashi, soko ni wa hyougen shitai to iu 'naihatsuteki na douki' ga ketsujo shiteiru. Ningen no sousaku wa, yorokobi ya kanashimi to itta kanjou ya, shakai e no toikake kara umareru mono de aru. Tannaru kekka to shite no utsukushisa dake de wa naku, sono haikei ni aru bunmyaku ya kattou koso ga, geijutsu no honshitsu o katachizukutteiru no de wa nai ka. Gijutsu ga shinka shite mo, hito ga hito de aru kagiri, kono 'nama no itonami' to shite no geijutsu no kachi ga yuragu koto wa nai darou.",
