    "romaji": "Gendai no jinkō chinō (AI) no shinka wa mezamashiku, geijutsu no bunya ni made oyonde iru. Shikashi, AI ga umidasu sakuhin wa, akudemodomo kako no dēta no chikuseki ni motozuku saikōsei ni suginai. Shin no imi de no 'dokusōsei' to wa, tannaru gijutsu no takumisa de wa naku, ningen no naimen kara wakidasu kattō ya jōnetsu ga katachi to natta mono de wa nai darō ka. Dore hodo AI ga seichi na mohō o okonō tomo, soko ni wa tamashii no sakebi ga ketsujo shite iru no de aru.",
