    "romaji": "Saikin, AI ga sakusei shita kaiga ya bunshou ga chuumoku wo atsumete iru. Shikashi, AI ga umidasu mono wa kako no boudai na deeta ni motozuku 'mouhou' ni suginai to iu hihan mo aru. Ippou de, ningen no dokusousei mo mata, kako no keiken no tsumikasane kara umareru mono de aru. Sou kangaeru to, AI to ningen no sousaku katsudou no aida ni, watashitachi ga hikou to shite iru kyoukaisen wa, angai aimai na mono na no kamoshirenai.",
