    "romaji": "AI no gijutsu kakushin wa mezamashiku, watashitachi no seikatsu o benri ni suru ippou de, ningen tokuyuu no haidanyoku ya rinrikan ga towareru bamen ga fuete iru. Tan ni kouritsu o motomeru dake de naku, gijutsu ga ningen ni dono you na eikyou o oyobosu ka o tsune ni kaerimiru hitsuyou ga aru. Gijutsu no shinpo o tomeru koto wa dekinai ga, sore o dou seigyo shi, kyouzon shite iku ka ga, kore kara no shakai ni okeru saidai no kadai de aru.",
